#: ../../source/3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md:142
#: 76397de697884de4a9cac8780c2ff238
msgid "The OCS2 arm controller uses Model Predictive Control:"
msgstr "OCS2 机械臂控制器使用模型预测控制（MPC）："

