#: ../../source/3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md:148
#: 50bfd7db6a2443b58034121f1a5011a9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Do not invent `/target_pose` or `/target_joint_positions` (`JointState`) "
"as a universal contract. Joint MoveJ on `basic_joint_controller` is "
"`/{controller}/target_joint_position` (`std_msgs/Float64MultiArray`). FSM"
" is `/fsm_command` (`std_msgs/Int32`). Per-controller lists: [FSM and "
"Topics](4-fsm_and_topics.md) and the controller pages."
msgstr ""
"不要把 `/target_pose` 或 `/target_joint_positions`（`JointState`）写成通用约定。`basic_joint_controller` 的关节 MoveJ 是 `/{controller}/target_joint_position`（`std_msgs/Float64MultiArray`）。FSM 是 `/fsm_command`（`std_msgs/Int32`）。各控制器列表见 [状态机与话题](4-fsm_and_topics.md) 和对应控制器页面。"

